# The database is committed by Jamie's decision (16 Sept 2026), on a public
# repo. It holds the papers' own headlines and standfirsts - about 57,000
# words of somebody else's copy. Worth knowing rather than forgetting:
# public repos are crawled by code-search indexes and dataset scrapers
# whether or not anyone visits them.
